# Keep Cloud Build upload context lean. Creating this file stops gcloud from
# deriving ignores from .gitignore, so heavy/derived dirs are listed explicitly.
# The platform build uses the REPO ROOT as context (only packages/platform is
# COPYed by its Dockerfile), so excluding everything below is safe.
.git
**/node_modules
**/target
**/.venv
**/.next
**/dist
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
